title: :geyser: Port Forwarding Guide
color: help
button: [Port Forwarding](https://wiki.geysermc.org/geyser/port-forwarding/)

---

We have a guide to set up port forwarding for your Geyser server. Geyser uses the UDP protocol and the default Minecraft Bedrock port is `19132`, but this can differ depending on your setup.